<title>USA: Ben &amp; Jerry's names Perry Odak CEO.</title>
<headline>Ben &amp; Jerry's names Perry Odak CEO.</headline>
<dateline>SOUTH BURLINGTON, Vt. 1997-01-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ben &amp; Jerry's Homemade Inc said on Thursday that it named Perry Odak as chief executive officer.</p>
<p>Odak replaces Robert Holland, who resigned in September, the company said.</p>
<p>Odak was previously part of the senior management of U.S. Repeating Arms Co (Winchester) and Browning, Ben &amp; Jerry's said.  Odak's other experience includes senior management positions at Dellwood Foods, Armour-Dial, and Jovan Inc over the past 25 years.</p>
</text>
